bunvex is an independent implementation written from scratch. Its design was informed by studying the
public architecture of Convex (https://github.com/get-convex/convex-backend); no Convex source code is
included.

bunvex is not affiliated with or endorsed by Convex, Inc. "Convex" is a trademark of Convex, Inc., used
only to describe compatibility.

bunvex's packages match the public API, behaviour and messages of these open-source projects of Convex, Inc.,
each licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. They were written for bunvex:

- convex (https://github.com/get-convex/convex-js), the client and function API: @bunvex/client, @bunvex/react,
  @bunvex/react-auth0, @bunvex/react-clerk, @bunvex/server and @bunvex/values.
- convex-test (https://github.com/get-convex/convex-test): @bunvex/testing.
- convex-helpers (https://github.com/get-convex/convex-helpers): @bunvex/helpers.
- Convex Auth (https://github.com/get-convex/convex-auth): @bunvex/auth.
- The Convex components @convex-dev/batch-worker (https://github.com/get-convex/batch-worker),
  @convex-dev/rate-limiter (https://github.com/get-convex/rate-limiter), @convex-dev/resend
  (https://github.com/get-convex/resend), @convex-dev/sharded-counter (https://github.com/get-convex/sharded-counter)
  and @convex-dev/workpool (https://github.com/get-convex/workpool): @bunvex/batch-worker, @bunvex/rate-limiter,
  @bunvex/resend, @bunvex/sharded-counter and @bunvex/workpool.

Third-party material bundled with the dashboard (@bunvex/ui, @bunvex/dashboard):

- mapcn (https://github.com/AnmolSaini16/mapcn), MIT License — the map component
  (packages/ui/src/components/map.tsx), modified to bundle MapLibre's worker and use no hosted basemap.
- Natural Earth (https://www.naturalearthdata.com), public domain — the countries of the analytics map,
  through world-atlas (https://github.com/topojson/world-atlas), ISC License.


Third-party data bundled with the server (@bunvex/server):

- rust-unidecode 0.3.0 (https://github.com/chowdhurya/rust-unidecode), Copyright (c) 2015 Amit Chowdhury,
